<title>PHILIPPINES: Ayala Land B down 7.41 pct at 25 pesos.</title>
<headline>Ayala Land B down 7.41 pct at 25 pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ayala Land B dropped by 2 pesos, or 7.41 percent, to 25 pesos in late trade on Monday on foreign selling, brokers said.  </p>
<p>&quot;Its still the negative market sentiment and the property scare,&quot; said Noel Reyes, research head at Anscor Hagedorn Securities Inc.</p>
<p>There has been a perceived glut in the high-end real estate sector which recently pushed down share prices of property stocks.</p>
<p>A total of 7.88 million Ayala Land B shares changed hands in late Monday trade.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418936 fax 8176267</p>
